# MarketScan Environment Variables
# -----------------------------------------------
# 1. Copy this file and rename it to just: .env
# 2. Get a FREE Groq API key at https://console.groq.com/
# 3. Paste your key below (replace the placeholder text)
# -----------------------------------------------
# Without a key the app still works — AI features just run in Local Mode.

GROQ_API_KEY=your_groq_api_key_here
